        "eyebrow": "Manufacturing",
        "heading": "Where and how it is made",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>EMBRAE products are made under contract at a third-party facility in Baddi, Himachal Pradesh. We do not own it, and saying so costs us nothing.</p><p>Contract manufacturing is how almost every skincare brand of our size is made. Brands that imply otherwise are usually describing a building they visit rather than one they run. We specify the formula, the actives and the doses; the facility manufactures and fills to that specification and to its own licensing.</p><p>DEVELOPMENT PLACEHOLDER — the facility name, city and license number must be confirmed before launch.</p>",
