    "quality-standards": {
      "type": "anchored-content",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "quality-standards",
        "eyebrow": "Quality",
        "heading": "Quality standards",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>An uncited certification is the weakest sentence on a page like this, so here is the standard we hold ourselves to and how to check it.</p><ul><li>Manufacturing under WHO-GMP conditions, with the certificate number and issuing body listed on request.</li><li>Cosmetic manufacturing license held by the facility, issued by the state drug controller.</li><li>Every batch retained and traceable by the batch code printed on your carton.</li></ul><p>DEVELOPMENT PLACEHOLDER — every certificate number, issuing body and expiry must be verified and printed here before launch. Any claim that cannot be evidenced gets removed rather than softened.</p>",
        "image_position": "none",
