    "ingredient-transparency": {
      "type": "anchored-content",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "ingredient-transparency",
        "eyebrow": "Transparency",
        "heading": "Full ingredient disclosure",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>This is the claim the rest of the brand rests on, so it is worth being exact about.</p><p>Every ingredient appears under its INCI name, in descending order of quantity, on the carton and on the product page. Every active is printed at the concentration it is dosed at. There are no proprietary blends anywhere in the range.</p><p>A blend exists so that a small quantity of an expensive ingredient can sit high on a list without anyone being able to check it. If you cannot see a number next to an active, assume there is a reason.</p><p>If anything on a pack disagrees with anything on this site, tell us. That is a mistake worth fixing publicly.</p>",
        "image_position": "none",
        "link_label": "Browse the ingredient library",
        "link": "/pages/education#ingredient-library",
        "link_style_secondary": true,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
        "padding_top": 72,
