    "returns-refunds": {
      "type": "anchored-content",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "returns-refunds",
        "eyebrow": "Returns",
        "heading": "Returns and refunds",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>Thirty days from delivery, unopened, no reason required.</p><p>Refunds are issued to the original payment method. Cards and UPI typically land within five to seven working days once we have received the return; cash-on-delivery orders are refunded by bank transfer, so we will ask for account details.</p><p>If a product reacted with your skin, the unopened rule does not apply. Send a photograph and we will refund it. We would rather carry that cost than have someone finish a bottle that is hurting them.</p><p>Return shipping is on us if the fault is ours — damage, the wrong item, or a reaction. Otherwise it is on you.</p>",
        "image_position": "none",
        "link_label": "",
        "link": "",
        "link_style_secondary": true,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72
