        "eyebrow": "Support",
        "heading": "How to reach a person",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>WhatsApp and email, both read by a person rather than a bot.</p><ul><li><strong>Hours:</strong> Monday to Saturday, 10am to 6pm IST.</li><li><strong>Response time:</strong> within one working day. That is the number we can meet in a bad week, not a good one.</li><li><strong>Reactions and safety questions</strong> jump the queue. Say so in the first line and we will answer the same day.</li></ul><p>We do not run a chatbot. If that means occasionally waiting until morning, that seems a fair trade for an answer from someone who knows the formulas.</p>",
